+# FloorForge — System Baseline
+
+**Base commit:** `794bfdf`
+**Date:** 2026-09-06
+**Method:** every file under `app/`, `lib/`, `components/`, `migrations/`, `scripts/`,
+`.github/` read and classified. Every claim below carries a `file:line` and, where it
+asserts a break, a command that reproduces it.
+
+This document changes no behaviour. It is the map the execution order is drawn from.
+
+---
+
+## 0. What this audit is not
+
+`audit/FINDINGS.md` asked whether the site *works*.
+`audit/PRODUCT_TRUTH.md` asked whether the site *describes the product the engineering
+documents describe*.
+
+Neither asked whether the **backend is real**. Nothing in `audit/scripts/` can see a
+database, an auth boundary, or a telemetry event. Every finding in §3 below is invisible
+to every instrument this repository currently owns, and four of them are fatal to the
+thing the company says is its moat.
+
+The short version: **the front of the product is genuinely good and honestly labelled.
+The back of the product does not exist yet, and in three places it is worse than absent —
+it is present, plausible, and wrong.**
+
